  <section>
    <h2>Quick Answer</h2>
    <p><strong>The 28th China Hi-Tech Fair (CHTF) is scheduled for November 26–28, 2026, at Shenzhen World Exhibition &amp; Convention Center in Bao’an, Shenzhen.</strong></p>
    <p>Plan your fair registration and Mainland China entry permission separately. You may need a Chinese visa, qualify for another visa-exemption arrangement, or use 240-hour visa-free transit if your passport and complete itinerary meet its conditions. Attending CHTF itself grants no visa exemption.</p>
    <p>Register early, carry your passport and admission confirmation, and check your exact border crossings before booking. Chinese immigration authorities make the final entry decision. Event registration rules may change; confirm official information before paying for non-refundable travel.</p>
  </section>

